	)
	(text "J11 keeps the original CPU board pinout (IO board J16 harness): +5 V, +-12 V and ground.\nExternal +5 V on J17 has priority: U2 turns the J11 path off whenever +5V_EXT is present (EXT_PRESENT high).\nLTC4412 + AO3401A ideal diodes stand in for the TPS2121 of ARCHITECTURE.md 9.3 (library part, about 4 A per path).\nJP1 (bridged by default) disconnects the J11 +5 V completely; leaving J17 unplugged forces J11."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 12.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "bde62702-015c-5283-acf0-2bdd4e0c270f")
	)
	(text "J11: power from the IO board (J16 harness)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
